"table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 323.1171875, 191.75, 334.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 349.9765625, 541.5, 395.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 411.4765625, 541.5, 456.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第二条 费用项目与基本材料\n\n本制度列举的常见费用项目包括因公交通、出差住宿、经批准的办公采购及与业务相关的会议支出。列举项目不代表无条件可报，申请仍需具有业务说明、真实支付凭据及相应审批材料。个人消费、与业务无关的订单不能混入同一申请。\n\n每份申请应注明费用类别、发生日期、业务事项、金额与对应附件。多人同行或代付时，应说明实际参与人员、代付关系和费用分摊方", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 3.478161, "vector_score": 0.396384}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c012", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r012", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第十二条 权限和故障"], "token_count": 129, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 600.1171875, 157.25, 611.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 626.9765625, 541.5, 654.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十二条 权限和故障\n\n系统无法上传附件或提交单据时，应记录发生时间、错误提示及申请单号，向内部服务渠道反馈。不要提供账号密码或验证码。技术故障本身不构成延期批准；本文没有规定故障期间的线下替代入口和期限豁免。", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 0.322332, "vector_score": 0.465504}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c007", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r007", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第七节 确认网络与业务访问"], "token_count": 221, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 426.6171875, 191.75, 438.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 453.4765625, 546.75, 481.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 497.4765625, 546.75, 525.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第七节 确认网络与业务访问\n\nVPN显示已连接但目标系统无法打开时，应记录目标系统名称、错误提示和发生时间。可以区分为网页无法访问、页面能够打开但登录失败、登录后缺少某项业务功能等不同现象，便于确认网络和业务权限问题。\n\n不应把“没有导出权限”等业务角色限制理解为VPN故障。例如某产品功能仅管理员可用时，网络连通并不能替代角色授权。相关产品权限应查阅对应产品", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 3.046782, "vector_score": 0.41716}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c001", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r001", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第一条目的与文件范围"], "token_count": 220, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 1, "bbox": [47.80028381347656, 186.30948486328126, 167.0894775390625, 197.76815185546874], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9976791322231293}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 1, "bbox": [47.80028381347656, 210.9244140625, 539.7625, 241.0564697265625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9984315316727821}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.22329406738281, 254.637109375, 540.185498046875, 285.1935546875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9986601700174048}], "snippet": "第一条目的与文件范围\n\n本制度用于说明费用单据的收集、提交、审核与补充材料流程，使申请人能够按照可核对的凭据说明实际业务支出。本文为虚构企业合成资料，扫描页中的制度名称、编号和业务示例不对应真实组织。\n\n本文未说明适用部门、具体员工类别、批准生效状态及与其他报销制度的替代关系。文件名称中的“乙”仅用于区分资料，不构成制度等级。不能因为版本日期晚于其他文件，就", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 1.320139, "vector_score": 0.45563}]}}
